{"title":"Career Roadmap · Feature Writer","role":"Feature Writer","summary":"A Feature Writer produces long-form, analytical, narrative, and human-interest stories that go beyond basic news reporting.","facts":{"Current degree":"BJMC / B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication","Course":"Sports / Business / Science Journalism"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Feature Writer produces long-form, analytical, narrative, and human-interest stories that go beyond basic news reporting."},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a conventional news report that primarily answers who, what, when, where, and why, feature writing explores:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Context"},{"text":"People"},{"text":"Experiences"},{"text":"Causes"},{"text":"Trends"},{"text":"Expert perspectives"},{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Background"},{"text":"Human impact"},{"text":"Narrative storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"With a specialization in Sports / Business / Science Journalism, the student can develop expertise in a specific reporting domain while building strong long-form writing skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential workplaces include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"Digital publications"},{"text":"News websites"},{"text":"Sports publications"},{"text":"Business publications"},{"text":"Science and technology media"},{"text":"News agencies"},{"text":"Media startups"},{"text":"Corporate editorial teams"},{"text":"Independent journalism platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The modern Feature Writer increasingly needs to combine writing + reporting + research + data + multimedia + digital publishing + AI-assisted workflows."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","BJMC / B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication","Journalism Fundamentals","Reporting / Writing Internship","Editorial Intern / Junior Reporter","Feature Writer","Senior Feature Writer","Specialist Writer / Correspondent","Senior Correspondent / Feature Editor","Editor / Section Editor","Managing / Editorial Leadership"]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Journalism Degree","Domain Knowledge","Reporting Internship","Beat Reporter","Specialist Feature Writer","Senior Writer","Feature Editor"]}]},{"heading":"What a Feature Writer Does","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional feature writer may handle the complete story process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Story Idea","Research","Pitch","Background Investigation","Source Identification","Interviews","Data Collection","Field Reporting","Story Structure","Writing","Fact Checking","Editing","Headline / SEO","Publication","Reader Feedback / Analytics"]},{"type":"p","text":"The writer is expected to develop original angles, not merely rewrite existing articles."}]},{"heading":"Difference Between News Writing & Feature Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["News Reporter","Feature Writer"],"rows":[[{"text":"Immediate event"},{"text":"Deeper story"}],[{"text":"Concise"},{"text":"Longer-form"}],[{"text":"Fast turnaround"},{"text":"More research time"}],[{"text":"Direct information"},{"text":"Context + narrative"}],[{"text":"Inverted pyramid often used"},{"text":"Flexible narrative structure"}],[{"text":"Primarily current event"},{"text":"Current event + broader context"}],[{"text":"Quotes support facts"},{"text":"Interviews may drive the narrative"}],[{"text":"Shorter articles"},{"text":"Long-form articles"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A feature can begin with a person, scene, question, unusual observation, statistic, or powerful moment rather than the conventional news lead."}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Journalism Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Media studies"},{"text":"Communication theory"},{"text":"Journalism ethics"},{"text":"Media law"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Basic photography"},{"text":"Digital media"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Writing exercises"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News reports"},{"text":"Profiles"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Human-interest stories"},{"text":"Reviews"},{"text":"Explainers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Reporting & Specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop stronger reporting skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Match reporting"},{"text":"Player profiles"},{"text":"Team analysis"},{"text":"Sports business"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Sports culture"},{"text":"Athlete interviews"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Companies"},{"text":"Markets"},{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Corporate earnings"},{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Financial terminology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Science Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific research"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Medicine and public health reporting"},{"text":"Climate and environment"},{"text":"Research papers"},{"text":"Scientific methodology"},{"text":"Expert interviews"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 / Advanced Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Long-form journalism"},{"text":"Investigative research"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Data journalism"},{"text":"Digital journalism"},{"text":"Multimedia storytelling"},{"text":"Podcasting"},{"text":"Video journalism"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Audience analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should begin developing a recognizable writing voice and subject specialization."}]},{"heading":"Feature Story Structure","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong feature can follow several structures."},{"type":"h","text":"Narrative structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Opening Scene","Character / Problem","Context","Expert Perspectives","Evidence / Data","Conflict / Development","Broader Meaning","Resolution / Reflection"]},{"type":"h","text":"Explainer feature"},{"type":"flow","items":["Question","Why It Matters","Background","Evidence","Expert Analysis","Examples","Implications","What Happens Next"]}]},{"heading":"Lead Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The opening paragraph is critical."},{"type":"h","text":"Common feature leads"},{"type":"h","text":"Scene lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with a specific moment."},{"type":"h","text":"Anecdotal lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with a person's experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Descriptive lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a strong sense of place."},{"type":"h","text":"Question lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Introduce a central question."},{"type":"h","text":"Contrarian lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Challenge an assumption."},{"type":"h","text":"Data lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Begin with a compelling statistic."},{"type":"p","text":"The lead should create enough curiosity for the reader to continue."}]},{"heading":"Core Feature-Writing Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Fact Checking"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Domain Knowledge"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Critical Thinking"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Data Literacy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Digital Publishing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Multimedia"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"AI Literacy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Research Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Feature Writer needs stronger research capabilities than a basic content writer."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Search primary sources"},{"text":"Read reports"},{"text":"Read research papers"},{"text":"Examine government data"},{"text":"Analyze company reports"},{"text":"Review statistics"},{"text":"Compare multiple sources"},{"text":"Identify conflicting claims"},{"text":"Verify quotes"},{"text":"Trace information to its original source"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research hierarchy"},{"type":"flow","items":["Primary Sources","Official Reports / Documents","Research Papers / Data","Expert Interviews","Reputable Secondary Sources","Social Media / Online Discussions"]},{"type":"p","text":"The lower levels should not automatically be treated as authoritative."}]},{"heading":"Interviewing Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Interviews are central to feature journalism."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Source identification"},{"text":"Interview preparation"},{"text":"Open-ended questions"},{"text":"Follow-up questions"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Note-taking"},{"text":"Recording with consent"},{"text":"Quote verification"},{"text":"Attribution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interview workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Subject","Prepare Questions","Conduct Interview","Listen for New Angles","Ask Follow-ups","Verify Key Facts","Transcribe / Organize","Integrate Quotes"]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong interviewer does not simply ask a prepared list of questions; they follow interesting answers."}]},{"heading":"Fact-Checking","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the most important professional skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Verify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Names"},{"text":"Dates"},{"text":"Numbers"},{"text":"Titles"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Quotes"},{"text":"Locations"},{"text":"Company information"},{"text":"Research findings"},{"text":"Historical claims"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fact-checking workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Claim","Identify Source","Find Original Evidence","Cross-Check","Confirm Context","Attribute","Publish"]},{"type":"p","text":"For scientific and business journalism, this becomes especially important because misleading interpretation can significantly distort the story."}]},{"heading":"Sports Feature Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Sports features can move beyond match results."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible topics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Athlete profiles"},{"text":"Rising talent"},{"text":"Sports psychology"},{"text":"Injury recovery"},{"text":"Women in sports"},{"text":"Grassroots sports"},{"text":"Sports technology"},{"text":"Sports economics"},{"text":"Fan culture"},{"text":"Athlete entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Esports"},{"text":"Sports analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example feature"},{"type":"h","text":"\"How Data Analytics Is Changing Cricket Strategy\""},{"type":"p","text":"Research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Team analysts"},{"text":"Player statistics"},{"text":"Coaches"},{"text":"Performance data"},{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"Experts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["human story","statistics","expert insight","analysis."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Business Feature Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Business journalism requires financial and economic literacy."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"EBITDA"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Market share"},{"text":"Funding"},{"text":"Mergers"},{"text":"Acquisitions"},{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"Interest rates"},{"text":"Supply chains"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example feature"},{"type":"h","text":"\"How India's Small Businesses Are Adapting to AI\""},{"type":"p","text":"Potential sources:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Entrepreneurs"},{"text":"Employees"},{"text":"Industry experts"},{"text":"Economists"},{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"Government data"}]}]},{"heading":"Science Feature Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Science journalism requires particular care."},{"type":"p","text":"The writer should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Sample size"},{"text":"Correlation vs causation"},{"text":"Statistical significance"},{"text":"Peer review"},{"text":"Research limitations"},{"text":"Scientific uncertainty"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Science story workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Paper","Understand Methodology","Identify Finding","Check Limitations","Interview Researchers","Seek Independent Expert View","Explain in Plain Language","Publish With Context"]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid converting preliminary research into exaggerated claims."}]},{"heading":"Data Journalism","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to turn datasets into stories."},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python/pandas"},{"text":"Data visualization tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data-story workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Dataset","Clean","Explore","Identify Pattern","Verify","Find Human Context","Visualize","Write Story"]},{"type":"p","text":"The best data feature combines numbers with people and context."}]},{"heading":"Digital Journalism Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern Feature Writer should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CMS"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Web formatting"},{"text":"Hyperlinks"},{"text":"Embeds"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Newsletter writing"},{"text":"Audience analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital article structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Headline","Lead","Subheading","Story","Quote","Visual / Data","Context","Conclusion","Related Content"]}]},{"heading":"SEO for Feature Writers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Headline optimization"},{"text":"Meta descriptions"},{"text":"Internal linking"},{"text":"Search-friendly headings"},{"text":"Structured content"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But SEO should not destroy the quality of the journalism."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong article should satisfy:"},{"type":"flow","items":["reader first","journalism second","optimization third"]}]},{"heading":"Multimedia Storytelling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Feature journalism increasingly extends beyond text."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Photography"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Portrait photography"},{"text":"Photo captions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Video"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"B-roll"},{"text":"Short documentaries"},{"text":"Reels"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Audio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Podcast interviews"},{"text":"Audio features"},{"text":"Voice narration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visual journalism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infographics"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Timelines"},{"text":"Maps"}]}]},{"heading":"AI Skills for Feature Writers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI can help with productivity but should not replace journalistic judgment."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brainstorming story angles"},{"text":"Research organization"},{"text":"Interview preparation"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Summarization"},{"text":"Headline alternatives"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Data exploration"},{"text":"Draft organization"},{"text":"Editing assistance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional AI workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Original Reporting","Research / Interviews","AI-Assisted Organization","Writer's Draft","Fact Checking","Editorial Review","Publication"]},{"type":"p","text":"Never treat an AI-generated factual claim, quote, citation, or statistic as verified without checking the original source."}]},{"heading":"Journalism Ethics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Essential principles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"Independence"},{"text":"Fairness"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Transparency"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Avoiding conflicts of interest"},{"text":"Avoiding plagiarism"},{"text":"Correcting errors"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Special care is required when reporting on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Children"},{"text":"Victims"},{"text":"Health"},{"text":"Sexual violence"},{"text":"Financial allegations"},{"text":"Unverified accusations"},{"text":"Vulnerable communities"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Long-Form Feature"},{"type":"p","text":"Write a 2,000–3,000 word feature based on original reporting."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Primary sources"},{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Narrative"},{"text":"Expert perspective"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Athlete Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a detailed profile of a local/regional athlete."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Background"},{"text":"Challenges"},{"text":"Career"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Expert perspectives"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Startup Feature"},{"type":"p","text":"Research a startup and create a business feature."},{"type":"p","text":"Cover:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Founder story"},{"text":"Problem"},{"text":"Business model"},{"text":"Market"},{"text":"Funding"},{"text":"Competition"},{"text":"Challenges"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Science Explainer"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a complex scientific topic and explain it for a general audience."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"How Generative AI Actually Learns Patterns\""},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Expert interviews"},{"text":"Research sources"},{"text":"Diagrams"},{"text":"Simple explanations"},{"text":"Limitations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Data Feature"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a feature using publicly available data."},{"type":"flow","items":["Data","Analysis","Chart","Human Story","Expert Quote","Feature"]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"h","text":"News organizations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Digital newsrooms"},{"text":"News agencies"},{"text":"Magazines"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized publications"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sports media"},{"text":"Business publications"},{"text":"Science/technology publications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Online magazines"},{"text":"News websites"},{"text":"Independent publications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Content organizations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research organizations"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Corporate editorial teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible internship titles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Editorial Intern"},{"text":"Reporting Intern"},{"text":"Feature Writing Intern"},{"text":"Digital Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Research Intern"},{"text":"Content Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Building a Feature-Writing Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The portfolio should contain quality rather than hundreds of articles."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended portfolio"},{"type":"table","header":["Work","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Long-form Features"},{"text":"5–8"}],[{"text":"Profiles"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Investigative/Research Features"},{"text":"2"}],[{"text":"Data Stories"},{"text":"2"}],[{"text":"Explainers"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"5+"}],[{"text":"Multimedia Stories"},{"text":"2–3"}],[{"text":"Domain-specific Articles"},{"text":"5+"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simple digital portfolio with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Short bio"},{"text":"Areas of expertise"},{"text":"Published work"},{"text":"Selected stories"},{"text":"Multimedia work"},{"text":"Contact information"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Fact Checking"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Domain Knowledge"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Journalism Ethics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Digital Journalism"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Data Literacy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Multimedia"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Social Media"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful supplementary skills include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Investigative journalism"},{"text":"Data journalism"},{"text":"Digital journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial literacy"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Financial statement basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific writing"},{"text":"Science communication"},{"text":"Research methodology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"CMS"},{"text":"SEO"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Multimedia"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Audio production"}]}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on career direction:"},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA Journalism"},{"text":"MA Mass Communication"},{"text":"Digital Journalism"},{"text":"Broadcast Journalism"},{"text":"Investigative Journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sports Journalism"},{"text":"Business Journalism"},{"text":"Science Communication"},{"text":"International Relations"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Public Policy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data-oriented"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Journalism"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Digital Media Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategic Communication"},{"text":"Corporate Communication"},{"text":"Public Relations"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Feature Writer can specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sports Features"},{"text":"Business Features"},{"text":"Science Features"},{"text":"Technology Features"},{"text":"Startup Journalism"},{"text":"Financial Journalism"},{"text":"Investigative Features"},{"text":"Human-Interest Stories"},{"text":"Culture & Lifestyle"},{"text":"Travel Writing"},{"text":"Environmental Journalism"},{"text":"Health Journalism"},{"text":"Political Features"},{"text":"Education Journalism"},{"text":"Data Journalism"},{"text":"Long-Form Journalism"},{"text":"Magazine Writing"},{"text":"Digital Journalism"},{"text":"Multimedia Storytelling"},{"text":"Newsletter Journalism"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Editorial Intern","Junior Reporter / Writer","Feature Writer","Senior Feature Writer","Specialist Correspondent","Senior Correspondent","Feature Editor","Section Editor","Managing Editor","Editorial Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative independent path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Feature Writer","Independent Journalist","Newsletter / Publication","Specialist Writer","Author / Media Entrepreneur"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Future journalism will increasingly involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"Automated transcription"},{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"Data journalism"},{"text":"Interactive storytelling"},{"text":"Immersive journalism"},{"text":"AR/VR"},{"text":"Automated data visualization"},{"text":"Audience analytics"},{"text":"Personalized newsletters"},{"text":"AI-assisted translation"},{"text":"Multimedia storytelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The journalist's differentiation will increasingly come from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["original reporting","access to sources","judgment","credibility","storytelling."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generate original story ideas"},{"text":"Pitch feature stories"},{"text":"Conduct interviews"},{"text":"Perform primary and secondary research"},{"text":"Verify information"},{"text":"Write strong leads"},{"text":"Structure long-form stories"},{"text":"Use narrative techniques"},{"text":"Analyze data"},{"text":"Interview experts"},{"text":"Write domain-specific features"},{"text":"Edit their own work"},{"text":"Understand journalism ethics"},{"text":"Use CMS platforms"},{"text":"Apply basic SEO"},{"text":"Create multimedia stories"},{"text":"Use AI responsibly"},{"text":"Build a professional journalism portfolio"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"BJMC / B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Feature Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Interviewing"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Storytelling"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Fact Checking"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Journalism Ethics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Sports / Business / Science Expertise"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SEO / CMS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Photography / Video / Audio"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-Assisted Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Professional Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Newsroom Internship"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this specialization, the strongest career strategy is to become a domain-focused journalist rather than a general content writer."},{"type":"p","text":"The recommended pathway is:"},{"type":"p","text":"BJMC / B.A. Journalism → Reporting Internship → Domain Specialization → Feature Writing → Digital Journalism → Specialist Correspondent → Senior Feature Writer / Feature Editor."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to take a subject from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["story idea","research","interviews","primary evidence","data","narrative","fact-checking","multimedia","digital publication"]},{"type":"p","text":"The combination of strong writing + original reporting + specialized domain knowledge + data literacy + multimedia + AI-assisted research gives the student a much stronger profile for modern journalism than writing skills alone."}]}]}